~ start
do CutsceneManager.player_face("right")
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(7359.0,500), 0.75, 1.5, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Fenn worry: [font_size=40]Huh,[wait=0.3] stuck...[/font_size]
Az: Hello? Can you hear me?
Fenn: Az? Where are you?
Az laugh: Let's GO!! It works! [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i].
Fenn: The bangle?
Az: Yeah! I've got the other one with me. You can talk to someone through them.
Az: Just- [wait=0.3]don't tell [color="B80006"]Post Master Parker[/color]. He'd freak out and call it [wave freq=7 amp=30]sacrilege[/wave] or something.
Az: Oh! [wait=0.3]And if there's anything in your way, [wait=0.3]I can reach my hand through and grab it.
Az: Just [color="521FA6"]use RT[/color] if there's something in your way.
Fenn starry: [wait=0.3][font_size=60]That's [shake level=10 rate=30]AWESOME.[/shake][/font_size]
Az: You think? [wait=0.3]Hah, thanks. It's really not much [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i].
Fenn worry: You cough a lot. Are you okay?
Az: Uh. Yeah, no, [wait=0.3]I'm fine. Just- [wait=0.3]something caught in my throat.
do EventFlags.set_flag("4-Az-BangleTalk-CellarGeneral", true)
=> END